      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你最近是不是睡得比较晚？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "你怎么知道？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你这几天早上总说很困。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "是，我常常十二点以后才睡。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "为什么这么晚？工作没做完吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "不是。我回家以后总想看一会儿手机。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "然后一会儿就变成一个小时了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，而且我常常没注意时间。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你可以睡前半小时不看手机。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我做什么？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "洗澡、准备明天的东西，或者听一点儿轻松的音乐。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "听起来比一直看手机好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你如果睡得够，白天也会更有精神。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我每天应该睡几个小时？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "每个人不一样，你先看看自己睡多久感觉最好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我先试试十一点半以前睡。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "可以，坚持几天再看感觉。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc012_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，今天就从放下手机开始。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
